WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From a seated position, place the right foot on the left thigh.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Then place the left foot on the right thigh (Half Lotus if only one).

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Lengthen the spine and rest the hands on the knees.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Breathe softly and stay only as long as the knees feel safe.
